OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloud and
OL,6,Frain gradually clearing northeastwards
OL,7,Fthrough the night. Some patchy drizzle
OL,8,Flingering behind the heaviest rain,
OL,9,Fbefore slowly clearing to leave drier
OL,10,Fconditions and some clearer spells by
OL,11,Fdawn.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FTurning windier through
OL,14,FWednesday as cloud and occasionally
OL,15,Fheavy rain push northeastwards across
OL,16,Fthe region. This moves through during
OL,17,Fthe day, allowing for some brighter
OL,18,Fspells by evening. Feeling chilly.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
