OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FBrighter skies and lighter winds
OL,7,FThursday. Occasionally heavy rain
OL,8,Farrives from the southwest Friday,
OL,9,Fbecoming windy overnight. A brief
OL,10,Fsettled spell returns Saturday before
OL,11,Ffurther rain arrives by evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
